  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Climate and Nutrition-Sensitive Approach to Tran</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &#x2018;Climate and Nutrition-Sensitive Approach to Transforming Sierra Leone&#x2019;s Food System&#x2019; will be implemented by WFP in collaboration with the Sierra Leone Agricultural Research Institute (SLARI) and the Ministry of Health and Sanitation&#x2019;s Directorate of Food and Nutrition (DFN). The project seeks to catalyse the productive capacity of communities in Kambia, Moyamba and Pujehun districts to reduce all forms of malnutrition through an effective and sustainable food systems approach.</narrative>
  </description>
